{#- How the spread is made, step 5 (build.njk): Products ▸ Layout, the two products set by hand (catalogue-art.js
    SETTINGS): the Party pack in Line-up with perspective, the Mixed case in Pins. -#}
{%- from "panel/ui.njk" import sel %}
<div class="pt-card">
  <p class="pt-label">Products ▸ Layout</p>
  <div class="pt-line"><span class="pt-title">Party pack</span><span class="pt-meta pt-right">410204 | Page 2</span></div>
  <div class="pt-modes"><span class="is-on">Line-up</span><span>Grid</span><span>Mosaic</span><span>Pins</span><span>Puzzle</span></div>
